{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:903c2fdbb2db7728d5f25d68ecc114c25252c70231e64eeead7ca0f28a9e7186", "source_text": "Omitted.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:872a8cfa74892c6e6464bd864d9f1c292f4f523caba3e51ac3dafbfc84db48f6", "unit_id": "tag:01W2:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-composition-proper}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7f43ea39e6ccd483a0e227cbc6f95c343f632d637c2fd126540ee2af682f093d", "source_text": "The composition of proper morphisms is proper.\nThe same is true for universally closed morphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:44d91026b6c1ffe17fa24ef797e21c4b8948687565522e276439f95341700618", "unit_id": "tag:01W3:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X \\to Y \\to Z$", "MATH_0002": "$Z' \\to Z$", "MATH_0003": "$Z' \\times_Z X = (Z' \\times_Z Y) \\times_Y X  \\to Z' \\times_Z Y$", "MATH_0004": "$Z' \\times_Z Y \\to Z'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-separated-permanence}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-composition-finite-type}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:4648f9a790ace27e18fe3edae1d6c78beac6b308d6903edd542020e037b46dee", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5b2ecc6fcf08e2919d65ef2c372d84621b4e7f81b7df3af73bcb45c434acb0da", "source_text": "A composition of closed morphisms is closed.\nIf <MATH_0001> are universally closed morphisms\nand <MATH_0002> is any morphism, then we see that\n<MATH_0003>\nis closed and <MATH_0004> is closed.\nHence the result for universally closed morphisms.\nWe have seen that ``separated'' and ``finite type''\nare preserved under compositions\n(Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001> and\nLemma <REF_0002>). Hence the\nresult for proper morphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:91ac6902be691fa4498d2434bfcf4ee387ce5dfebf473ca791a1127e30d2ae50", "unit_id": "tag:01W3:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-base-change-proper}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:ccc208e968aa478e1ef911562c3b6a17e06b2ce0a5af32c1f203acc7dbba8555", "source_text": "The base change of a proper morphism is proper.\nThe same is true for universally closed morphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f92b1177097893db214332b5ea17ba31483229b990e67b83a2288d452a6cffa6", "unit_id": "tag:01W4:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-separated-permanence}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-base-change-finite-type}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b5709b27a29ac96625d51d46e89aebb8ac5c8dad46d84b784a1632fec89bb664", "source_text": "This is true by definition for universally closed morphisms.\nIt is true for separated morphisms\n(Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001>).\nIt is true for morphisms of finite type\n(Lemma <REF_0002>).\nHence it is true for proper morphisms.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:14c990bdc12933bd574bcf8d802ccb9a7922ab5459aa235fcbc13f2b00267b00", "unit_id": "tag:01W4:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-closed-immersion-proper}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:90852d61dce618d345f49bcd172b3f3b3e56baf28c9316b2e8245c4683242284", "source_text": "A closed immersion is proper, hence a fortiori universally closed.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:336b98f551e5c4c01e7e7ffec89e96a860f1ebc29e4c4e87772a886157f4aa33", "unit_id": "tag:01W5:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "01W0", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-base-change-immersion}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{schemes-lemma-immersions-monomorphisms}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-immersion-locally-finite-type}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:03ac800c540d698bbf93b93782e6150fec102f7bec9771c317f72aaebf84418e", "source_text": "The base change of a closed immersion is a closed immersion\n(Schemes, Lemma <REF_0001>).\nHence it is universally closed.\nA closed immersion is separated\n(Schemes, Lemma <REF_0002>).\nA closed immersion is of finite type\n(Lemma <REF_0003>).\nHence a closed immersion is proper.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:48f689b97fc984b602f19cea48188d6dbb60ea79ca2a9dcaaaaca4d2bd0d68e4", "unit_id": "tag:01W5:proof"}
